3. Layer BreakdownA. Data Ingestion Layer (Input)Notification Listener Service (Android Native / Plugin):Mendengarkan notifikasi masuk dari aplikasi keuangan/e-wallet (GoPay, OVO, Bank).Meneruskan teks notifikasi ke Regex Parser.On-Device OCR Engine:Menggunakan google_mlkit_text_recognition.Memproses gambar kuitansi/struk digital dari galeri atau kamera secara lokal.B. Business Logic & Processing LayerRegex Parser Engine:Mengekstrak pola data spesifik dari teks notifikasi/OCR:Pattern: (?:RP|IDR|\$)\s?([\d.,]+) -> AmountPattern: (?:ke|at|paid to)\s+([A-Za-z0-9\s]+) -> Merchant/Service NameSubscription Scheduler & Logic Engine:Menghitung next_billing_date berdasarkan siklus (monthly, yearly, weekly).Menghitung total Monthly Burn Rate:$$\text{Total Monthly} = \sum \text{Monthly Costs} + \sum \left(\frac{\text{Yearly Costs}}{12}\right)$$C. Storage & State Management LayerLocal Database (SQLite / Hive):Menyimpan data langganan, riwayat transaksi, dan preferensi pengguna.State Management:Mengelola siklus hidup data (State) antara layar UI, pengingat notifikasi, dan database lokal.D. Presentation & Service LayerUser Interface (UI):Dashboard Screen: Menampilkan burn rate, statistik, dan daftar tagihan terdekat.Add/Edit Form: Input manual atau konfirmasi hasil konversi OCR/Notifikasi.Detail & Cancel Screen: Menampilkan rincian tagihan beserta tombol pintas deep link pembatalan.Local Notification Service:Menggunakan flutter_local_notifications untuk mendaftarkan jadwal pengingat (scheduled tasks) pada level sistem OS (H-3 dan H-1 sebelum tagihan).4. Database Schema (SQLite)SQL-- Table: subscriptions
CREATE TABLE subscriptions (
    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
    name TEXT NOT NULL,
    category TEXT DEFAULT 'General',
    amount REAL NOT NULL,
    currency TEXT DEFAULT 'IDR',
    billing_cycle TEXT NOT NULL, -- 'weekly', 'monthly', 'yearly'
    next_billing_date TEXT NOT NULL, -- ISO8601 String (YYYY-MM-DD)
    is_trial INTEGER DEFAULT 0,  -- 0 = False, 1 = True
    trial_end_date TEXT,
    cancel_url TEXT,
    created_at TEXT DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

-- Table: notification_logs (Audit trail for auto-detected alerts)
CREATE TABLE notification_logs (
    id TEXT PRIMARY KEY,
    raw_text TEXT NOT NULL,
    parsed_merchant TEXT,
    parsed_amount REAL,
    is_processed INTEGER DEFAULT 0,
    received_at TEXT DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);
5. Technology Stack & ConstraintsFramework: Flutter (Target: Android Platform)Language: DartArchitecture Pattern: Clean Architecture / Feature-First PatternCore Libraries:sqflite / hive (Local Storage)google_mlkit_text_recognition (OCR)flutter_local_notifications (Scheduled Alerts)url_launcher (Deep-link handling ke halaman pembatalan)Constraints: Tidak ada backend API, tidak ada otentikasi server, serverless, 100% data tersimpan di HP pengguna.
